msgctxt "IncrementalResearch.STRINGS.UI.SINGULARITY.CONFIRM_RESET"
msgid "Insight, Meta-Insight, everything bought with them, the paradigm shift count and the facility blueprints are reset."
msgstr "知見、メタ知見、それらで買ったもの、パラダイムシフトの回数、設備の設計図がリセットされます。"

msgctxt "IncrementalResearch.STRINGS.UI.SINGULARITY.CONFIRM_KEEP"
msgid "Critical Constant and everything bought with it are kept. Buildings already built stay as they are."
msgstr "臨界定数とそれで買ったものは残ります。建てた設備には何も起こりません。"

msgctxt "IncrementalResearch.STRINGS.UI.SINGULARITY.CONFIRM_OK"
msgid "Singularity"
msgstr "シンギュラリティ"

msgctxt "IncrementalResearch.STRINGS.UI.TUTORIAL.STAGE13_TITLE"
msgid "Singularity"
msgstr "シンギュラリティ"

msgctxt "IncrementalResearch.STRINGS.UI.TUTORIAL.STAGE13_BODY"
msgid ""
"<b>Beyond the End of Knowledge, the Journey Continues</b>\n"
"\n"
"<i>Insight keeps being born. Its accumulation comes to foresee even its own end, and in exchange for everything that came before, it scoops an 'answer' out of the sea of singularity. What that answer answers is uncertain, but that it is useful is beyond doubt. Incidentally, the only Critical Constant confirmed so far is '42'.</i>\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Everything for a singularity is in sight. Deliver Data Banks to the Record Archive (Duplicants carry them in); the Insight tab shows how many are needed. A singularity resets the idle game and grants Critical Constant (CC), which buys permanent expansions and automation."
msgstr ""
"<b>知の終わりの向こう、旅は続く</b>\n"
"\n"
"<i>知見は生まれ続けています。その積み重ねはやがて自らの終着点さえも見通し、それまでの全てと引き換えに、特異点の海から『答え』をすくい上げます。臨界定数と名付けられたそれが何の『答え』なのかは定かでなくとも、有用であることだけは確かです。なお、現在までに確認されている臨界定数は「42」のみです。</i>\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"シンギュラリティが視野に入りました。記録保管庫にデータバンクを納品してください(複製人間が運び込みます)。必要な数は知見タブに表示されます。シンギュラリティは放置ゲームをリセットする代わりに、臨界定数(CC)をもたらします。CCは、永続する拡張と自動化の購入に使えます。"

